<title>HONG KONG: CEPA shares resume trade sharply higher.</title>
<headline>CEPA shares resume trade sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Consolidated Electric Power Asia Ltd (CEPA) soared HK$1.60 to resume trading at HK$17.70 on Friday following the announcement of a takeover deal by Southern Co.</p>
</text>
